<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy Policy for Integrated Payroll.">
	<PageHero title="Privacy Policy for Integrated Payroll" />
	<section class="section"><div class="container post-content"><p>At Integrated Payroll, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This policy explains the types of information collected and how we use it.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>If you contact us directly, we may receive your name, email address, phone number, message contents, attachments, and any other information you choose to provide.</p><h2>How we use your information</h2><p>We use information to provide, operate, maintain, improve, personalize, and expand our website and services, communicate with you, send emails, and prevent fraud.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, please contact us.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>